EXIT:0

docket trace

  docket trace <session_id>              Render one trace human-readable
  docket trace tail <project>            Follow the most-recent session
  docket trace export <project>          Raw JSONL passthrough
    [--since YYYY-MM-DD]                 Filter by date
  docket trace ingest <project>          Manually ingest new session turns
  docket trace expire [project]          Delete terminated traces past retention
    [--dry-run]                          Preview without deleting
    [--days N]                           Override the retention window

  Traces live at: <HOME>/.openclaw/traces/<project>/<session_id>.jsonl
  Default retention: 30 days (TRACE_RETENTION_DAYS)

